{"id":"verse_","lemma":"versé","pos":"adj","rank":4227,"glosses":["versed, knowledgeable (in something), conversant (with something)"],"forms":{"feminine":"versée","masculinePlural":"versés","femininePlural":"versées"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-vers%C3%A9.wav","examples":[{"text":"Il n'a pas versé une larme.","en":"He didn't shed a tear.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"tear"}]},{"text":"J'ai versé l'eau dans le seau.","en":"I poured water into the bucket.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"pail, bucket"}]},{"text":"Tom s'est versé plus de café.","en":"Tom poured more coffee for himself.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"coffee"}]},{"text":"Elle a versé de l'eau dans la cuvette.","en":"She poured water into the basin.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"basin, bowl"}]},{"text":"Il s'est versé de l'eau froide sur lui.","en":"He poured cold water over himself.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"},{"g":"cold","l":"froid"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"him, he, it"}]}]}